---
/**
 * How a request reaches an app on a Calimero cluster: the client verifies a
 * node's attestation, opens a sealed channel, any node checks the caller and
 * forwards to the app's leader, which runs the WASM and replicates the
 * result. Nodes take their storage key from mero-kms after proving their
 * image. SVG coloured only through the theme tokens.
 */
---

<figure class="cal-cluster not-content">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 860 380" role="img" aria-labelledby="cal-cluster-title cal-cluster-desc">
		<title id="cal-cluster-title">A request on a Calimero cluster</title>
		<desc id="cal-cluster-desc">
			A client verifies the node's TDX attestation and opens a sealed channel to it. The node checks the caller against the
			cluster's system group and forwards the call to the app's leader, which runs the WASM and replicates the result to the
			app's other replicas. Nodes get their storage key from mero-kms only after proving their image.
		</desc>
		<defs>
			<marker id="cal-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="fill-seal"></path>
			</marker>
		</defs>

		<!-- client -->
		<rect x="16" y="140" width="170" height="96" class="box"></rect>
		<text x="32" y="166" class="k">Client</text>
		<text x="32" y="192" class="t">mero-js · Python</text>
		<text x="32" y="212" class="t">Rust · meroctl</text>

		<!-- verify + sealed channel -->
		<line x1="186" y1="172" x2="304" y2="172" class="wire" marker-end="url(#cal-arrow)"></line>
		<text x="194" y="160" class="s">1 · verify</text>
		<line x1="186" y1="206" x2="304" y2="206" class="wire seal" marker-end="url(#cal-arrow)"></line>
		<text x="194" y="230" class="s">2 · seal</text>

		<!-- cluster frame -->
		<rect x="306" y="24" width="538" height="336" class="frame"></rect>
		<text x="322" y="48" class="k">Cluster · attested Intel TDX nodes</text>

		<!-- any node -->
		<rect x="324" y="130" width="160" height="116" class="box tee"></rect>
		<text x="340" y="156" class="k">Any node</text>
		<text x="340" y="182" class="t">checks caller and</text>
		<text x="340" y="200" class="t">access against the</text>
		<text x="340" y="218" class="t">system group</text>

		<!-- forward -->
		<line x1="484" y1="188" x2="566" y2="188" class="wire" marker-end="url(#cal-arrow)"></line>
		<text x="492" y="176" class="s">3 · forward</text>

		<!-- app group -->
		<rect x="568" y="72" width="256" height="232" class="group"></rect>
		<text x="584" y="96" class="k">App group · its own Raft log</text>
		<rect x="584" y="112" width="224" height="64" class="box tee lead"></rect>
		<text x="600" y="138" class="b">Leader</text>
		<text x="600" y="160" class="t">runs the WASM call</text>
		<rect x="584" y="224" width="104" height="60" class="box tee"></rect>
		<text x="598" y="250" class="b">Replica</text>
		<text x="598" y="270" class="t">applies diff</text>
		<rect x="704" y="224" width="104" height="60" class="box tee"></rect>
		<text x="718" y="250" class="b">Replica</text>
		<text x="718" y="270" class="t">applies diff</text>
		<line x1="636" y1="176" x2="636" y2="222" class="wire" marker-end="url(#cal-arrow)"></line>
		<line x1="756" y1="176" x2="756" y2="222" class="wire" marker-end="url(#cal-arrow)"></line>
		<text x="648" y="204" class="s">4 · replicate</text>

		<!-- kms -->
		<rect x="324" y="292" width="160" height="52" class="box"></rect>
		<text x="340" y="314" class="k">mero-kms</text>
		<text x="340" y="334" class="t">storage key after proof</text>
		<line x1="404" y1="292" x2="404" y2="248" class="wire dash" marker-end="url(#cal-arrow)"></line>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>
		The client trusts nothing on the network: it checks the node's quote against a signed mero-tee release before it sends
		anything. Nobody operating the nodes can read the app's state.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.cal-cluster {
		margin: 1.75rem 0;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}
	svg {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		min-width: 620px;
		height: auto;
		font-family: var(--sl-font);
	}
	.frame {
		fill: var(--cal-paper-2);
		stroke: var(--cal-rule);
		stroke-width: 1;
	}
	.group {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--cal-box-line);
		stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
	}
	.box {
		fill: var(--cal-card);
		stroke: var(--cal-box-line);
		stroke-width: 1;
	}
	.box.tee {
		stroke: var(--cal-ink);
	}
	.box.lead {
		stroke: var(--cal-seal);
		stroke-width: 1.5;
	}
	.k {
		font: 600 10.5px var(--sl-font-mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		fill: var(--cal-seal);
	}
	.b {
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 14px;
		fill: var(--cal-ink);
	}
	.t {
		font-size: 12.5px;
		fill: var(--cal-ink-2);
	}
	.s {
		font: 500 10.5px var(--sl-font-mono);
		fill: var(--cal-muted);
	}
	.wire {
		stroke: var(--cal-ink-2);
		stroke-width: 1.5;
	}
	.wire.seal {
		stroke: var(--cal-seal);
		stroke-width: 2;
	}
	.wire.dash {
		stroke-dasharray: 4 3;
	}
	.fill-seal {
		fill: var(--cal-seal);
	}
	figcaption {
		margin-top: 10px;
		font: 400 0.8rem/1.5 var(--sl-font-mono);
		color: var(--cal-muted);
	}
</style>
